        "cont \"WILL.\"",
        "para \"I have trained all\"",
        "line \"around the world,\"",
        "para \"making my psychic\"",
        "line \"#MON powerful.\"",
        "para \"And, at last, I've\"",
        "line \"been accepted into\"",
        "cont \"the ELITE FOUR.\"",
        "para \"I can only keep\"",
        "line \"getting better!\"",
        "para \"Losing is not an\"",
